---
const inPrototype = [
  "Notebooks with strict isolation",
  "PDF, text & Markdown, pasted text, web URLs",
  "Source selection per question",
  "Grounded chat with streamed answers",
  "Citations that open the exact passage",
  "Notes, with citations preserved",
  "Single-narrator audio overviews (in development)",
];

const notYet = [
  "Web research & source discovery",
  "Sharing & collaboration",
  "Mind maps, flashcards, quizzes",
  "Two-host or interactive audio",
  "YouTube, Drive & audio-file import",
  "Multi-language output",
];
---

<section id="scope" class="border-line border-y">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-20">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Scope</p>
    <h2 class="font-display max-w-xl text-4xl leading-tight font-medium tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">
      Small on purpose
    </h2>
    <p class="text-ink-soft mt-5 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
      Marginalia is a working prototype, built in the open. The first milestone is the loop above —
      notebooks → sources → grounded chat → citations → notes — done properly, before anything
      else.<a href="#fn-3" class="cite" aria-label="Footnote 3">3</a> Features that aren't built
      yet aren't sold on this page; the cut list is public, and so is every architectural
      decision.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="bg-card border-line rounded-xl border p-6">
        <h3 class="font-mono text-sm font-medium tracking-[0.14em] uppercase">In the prototype</h3>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-[0.95rem]">
          {
            inPrototype.map((item) => (
              <li class="flex gap-2.5">
                <span aria-hidden="true" class="bg-mark mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full" />
                <span>{item}</span>
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-dashed border-[#c9c9bd] p-6">
        <h3 class="font-mono text-ink-soft text-sm font-medium tracking-[0.14em] uppercase">
          Not yet — and not pretended
        </h3>
        <ul class="text-ink-soft mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-[0.95rem]">
          {
            notYet.map((item) => (
              <li class="flex gap-2.5">
                <span aria-hidden="true" class="border-ink-soft mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full border" />
                <span>{item}</span>
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
